    "title": "d\u0113zl\u2122",
    "description": "The d\u0113zl app on your smartphone pairs with a compatible Garmin truck navigator or d\u0113zl\u2122 Edition smartwatch to access features designed to enhance your over-the-road lifestyle.\r\n \r\nConnected Features:\r\n\u2022 See live weather, traffic, fuel prices and more on a compatible Garmin navigator.\r\n\u2022 Receive text messages, phone calls, and alerts on your paired Garmin device.\r\n\u2022 Receive PrePass\u00ae notifications of upcoming U.S. weigh stations and bypass decisions with your active PrePass account.\r\n\u2022 Access workout tutorials that fit within standard break times when paired with your compatible d\u0113zl Edition smartwatch.\r\n\u2022 Check and use travel plaza reward points from your wrist, when paired with your compatible d\u0113zl Edition smartwatch.",
